{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Build workspace candidates before packing** \u2014 `--ignore-scripts` suppresses core's `prepack` build, while both candidate manifests publish only ignored `dist*` directories. A clean `npm test` therefore packs candidates without entry points, while stale output from an earlier build can make these compatibility tests exercise old code. Build both workspace candidates before packing, or add and enable reliable `prepack` hooks for them.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74l7_K","finding_digest":"4f47773c4a23b1f9b06825a9b455381bd4501e4205ba554b1b718e48df17eb92","finding_id":"arf_v1_j5dxopckeoy7tmdiewu3ivjydp","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/helpers/installed-core-fixture.ts::installedcorefixture::candidate-pack-requires-prebuilt-dist","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/helpers/installed-core-fixture.ts::installedcorefixture::candidate-pack-requires-prebuilt-dist","line":159,"observation_digest":"f56231bad088138b4f9c7e41eb8d59b28319bd9b4908e0b30fe2012c7a964d6d","observation_id":"aro_v1_6vrddowqrajywt44pza6xdkzwk","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/__tests__/helpers/installed-core-fixture.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_j5dxopckeoy7tmdiewu3ivjydp","published_at":"2026-10-02T23:36:27Z","review_id":"arr_v1_no7i6yrhps55eh5ka6h6e2pr2t","reviewed_base_sha":"0ee6c027ca3b58f3bf270fdf4a9ac87b73752467","reviewed_head_sha":"f4307c6ff2c87bc011787f2ab05b61af98c22555","reviewer":"codex","start_line":159,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":956},"record_id":"art_v1_x2lt5gknw3k7icfnqs5wjmmlai","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T23:36:27Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
